                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A = (V, \mu)
          %p
            Apply this example to the construction of deformation quantization. The star product is uniquely determined by
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi θ
                  %mo :
                  %mi A
